173f082cb861.plain:
In your Command phase: pick one WARPMELD PACT PSYKER model from your army. For every one of your TZAANGOR units within 6" of that model:
- if the unit has the BRAY keyword, up to D3+1 of its destroyed models return to it with full wounds;
- if not, up to 1 destroyed model returns to it with full wounds.

3e5cd41a315f.plain:
Models in this unit don't use the normal Rapid Fire rules. Instead, a model shooting a Rapid Fire weapon makes twice as many attacks if any of these is true:
- its unit is within half the weapon's range;
- the model is INFANTRY and, in your previous Movement phase, its unit Remained Stationary;
- the model is a TERMINATOR.

For this ability, a Rapid Fire bolt weapon means any bolt weapon of the Rapid Fire type.

5abf2c7a8c55.plain:
In each THOUSAND SONS Detachment in your army:
- the number of THOUSAND SONS CULTISTS units can't exceed how many RUBRIC MARINES or SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATORS units it has;
- the number of BRAY units can't exceed how many RUBRIC MARINES or SCARAB OCCULT TERMINATORS units it has.
